            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[The interface is now in English.

Every string the app shows — the panel, the gear menu, the permission warning,
the display names and the `--diagnose` report — was Turkish and is now English.
The calibration summary distinguishes "1 point" from "3 points" rather than
reusing a single form.

Source comments remain Turkish; identifiers and UI text are uniformly English.

This release was built and published by CI rather than by hand.
]]></description>
