        <item>
            <title>1.0.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 11:56:00 +0300</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Grkmyldz148/ScreenControl</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/Grkmyldz148/ScreenControl/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>1.0.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[First public release.

- Per-display brightness sliders for the built-in panel and DDC/CI monitors.
- `F1`/`F2` drive both displays together through a calibration curve you teach it.
- True black on external monitors: gamma dimming below DDC zero, then backlight off.
- On-screen HUD, hot-plug and sleep handling, `--diagnose` troubleshooting mode.
- Signed and notarized, with automatic updates.
]]></description>
